{"work_id": "MX3-010", "matched_key": "第二次世界大战的转折点", "normalized_offset": 3, "normalized_context": "884第二次世界大战的转折点一九四二年十月十二日斯大林格勒之战英美报纸比之为凡尔登战役红色凡尔登之名已传遍于世界这个比拟并不适当今天的斯大林格勒之战比起第一次世界大战时的凡尔登来有性质的不同但有一点是相同的即有许多人在这种时候还被德国的攻势所迷惑以为德国还有获胜的可能第一次世界大战结束于一九一八年冬在一九一六年德军曾向法国要塞凡尔登举行数度的进攻当时德军的战役统帅是德国皇太子投入战斗的力量是德军的最精锐部分当时的战斗是带决战性的德军猛攻不克整个德奥土保阵线再也找不到出路从此日益困难众", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/4c7451f802ad6cc211c9bec38ffc1acd46133/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "db32b9fe81193d6391370affabe7b05b930968e84a81546362eba301a8e72fdd", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 3, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 105, "end": 105, "record_path": "archive/records/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第三卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-b22257cb8d1ab637", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX3-010", "matched_key": "第二次世界大战的转折点", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "第二次世界大战的转折点885的表现而在战争中又以攻击斯大林格勒表现它自己的最后挣扎在这个历史的转折点面前全世界反法西斯阵线内的人们也有许多被法西斯的凶恶面孔所迷惑看不出它的实质自从八月二十三日德军全部渡过顿河河曲全面地开始攻击斯大林格勒九月十五日德军一部打入该城西北部工业区至十月九日苏联情报局宣布红军突破该区德军包围线为止共计进行了四十八天人类历史上无与伦比的空前苦战这一战终于胜利了在这四十八天中这个城市每天的胜负消息紧系着无数千万万万人民的呼吸使他们忧愁使他们欢乐这一战不但是", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/4c7451f802ad6cc211c9bec38ffc1acd46133/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "db32b9fe81193d6391370affabe7b05b930968e84a81546362eba301a8e72fdd", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 3, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 106, "end": 106, "record_path": "archive/records/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第三卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-8d6a8bcc07ec2bdd", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX3-010", "matched_key": "第二次世界大战的转折点", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "第二次世界大战的转折点887拿希特勒在第一阶段上的情况和第三阶段作比较就可知希特勒是处在最后失败的门口了目前红军在斯大林格勒和高加索两方面实际上均已停止了德军的进攻希特勒已到再衰三竭之时他对斯大林格勒高加索两处的进攻已经失败他在去年十二月至今年五月整个冬季中所整备的一点兵力已经耗竭了在苏德战线距冬季不到一个月了他须赶快转入防御整个顿河的以西以南是他的最危险的地带红军将在这一带转入反攻今年冬季希特勒因被死亡所驱迫将再一次整备他的军队他或者还可能搜索他的一点残余力量装备出几个新的师", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/4c7451f802ad6cc211c9bec38ffc1acd46133/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "db32b9fe81193d6391370affabe7b05b930968e84a81546362eba301a8e72fdd", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 3, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 108, "end": 108, "record_path": "archive/records/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第三卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-29bbf4d511648ac8", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
